      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "An Arabic annex of the Pandemic Influenza Preparedness (PIP) Framework setting out the terms of reference for WHO Global Influenza Surveillance and Response System laboratories handling PIP biological materials, starting with general information on the network's four types of laboratories. It describes the roles of essential regulatory laboratories in the network. It ends with an editor's note clarifying that references to the standard material transfer agreement mean SMTA 1. The Arabic extraction uses presentation-form characters but is legible.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
