      "narrative": [
        {
          "text": "Lists the core terms of reference that essential regulatory laboratories must meet, such as advising WHO on selecting H5N1 and other potentially pandemic viruses for vaccines and helping WHO and Member States with the vaccine aspects of pandemic preparedness plans. It also covers developing reference reagents and sharing materials under the standard material transfer agreement. It ends with the editor's note on SMTA 1, an ISBN and WHO's Geneva address.",
          "lang": "en",
          "state": "draft",
